RUNTIME TELEMETRY DISCLOSURE:
EventViewer includes an optional, anonymous runtime telemetry subsystem that records
local application launch counts, session duration, event stream inspection counts,
and software update checks/downloads. By default, an anonymous heartbeat header is
sent when querying the official GitHub Releases API (LowEffortDigital/EventViewer)
containing only aggregate counters and hardware architecture (Apple Silicon vs. Intel).
No personal data, log message contents, file paths, or IP addresses are collected.
Users may inspect, export, reset, or completely disable runtime telemetry at any time
in Settings -> General -> Runtime Usage & Download Telemetry.

